# 🕸️ KSP Sentinel AI — Phase 2: Graphify-Referenced Network Intelligence & Agentic Tool Suite

## 1. Architectural Vision & Paradigm Shift

This architecture combines two specialized autonomous agents:
1. **`NetworkIngestionAgent`**: Automatically evaluates any uploaded stream (CSV, Excel `.xlsx`, SQL, NoSQL), calculates the Graph Feasibility Score ($0-100\%$), extracts multi-relational primitives, and constructs the deterministic graph topology.
2. **`GraphQueryToolAgent`**: A dedicated tool-calling specialist in the Chatbot that answers relational inquiries (*"How is Person A connected to Crime Person B?"*) using deterministic BFS/Dijkstra graph traversal without hallucinations.
3. **Graphify-Inspired Interactive Portal Window**: A full-screen dark-theme Force-Directed Canvas modeled directly on **Graphify's HTML visualizer** (community clusters, God node prominence, 1-hop/2-hop neighborhood isolation, interactive path tracing, and forensic inspector drawer).

